      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>resourceLoader</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> does not expose a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>.</dd>",
